{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13203260","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13203260","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1320326001:1":{"text":"材料集めに付き合ってくれて感謝する。早速絵の修復作業に取りかかろうと思う。","source_cn":"多谢你们陪我找到这些材料。之后我要开始修复画作了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA2D669C0CC34751","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320326002:1":{"text":"まずはこの護符を……","source_cn":"至于这个护符……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD10BEDC6FDB29BE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:4::2":{"text":"リュボミルの護符","source_cn":"柳博米尔的护符","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7CD923C36D6B78D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320326003:2":{"text":"待ってください、リュボミルさん！護符を砕くつもりですか！？","source_cn":"……等等！柳博米尔，你为什么要打碎它？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63713B02B1DD390B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320326004:1":{"text":"これは、ラピスラズリでできているからな。","source_cn":"因为它——青金石。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF54F16DADF9402E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320326005:1":{"text":"菌粉を加えた絵の具の彩度が落ちないよう、ラピスラズリの粉末を混ぜる必要があるのだ。","source_cn":"想要修复这幅画，必须在颜料中加入青金石粉末，这样才能在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x533E31ADDCFF0D5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320326006:1":{"text":"ですが、それはとても貴重な宝石ですよ。それにその護符は、生前のあなたが希望を託した大事な物ではないのですか？","source_cn":"可是……青金石这么稀有的宝石很贵重，而且这个护符又承载...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1515E14FE4A1926","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320326007:1":{"text":"それを砕いてしまうなんて……","source_cn":"就这样毁掉，是不是太可惜了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBF0C460BD26AA1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1320326007":{"text":"それを砕いてしまうなんて……","source_cn":"就这样毁掉，是不是太可惜了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBF0C460BD26AA1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320326010:1":{"text":"護符を埋めた者はもう死んだ。彼の命はとうの昔に終わりを迎えたのだ。だからこの護符や……そこに込めた希望には、もう何の意味もない。","source_cn":"埋下护符的人已经死了，那段生命中的一切都已经彻底结束。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BD39F09DC94C16D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320326011:1":{"text":"修復作業は僕に任せてくれ。すまないが、スノーシダー町へ行って、このことを<style=\"highlight\">レフスキー殿</style>に伝えてくれないだろうか？","source_cn":"修复工作交给我就好。劳烦你们再去一趟雪松镇，将这个消息...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5D0D156A91ADCC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320326012:1":{"text":"修復した絵を彼に返したいので、もう少し待っていてくれと。","source_cn":"请他再耐心等待一阵。等这幅画恢复原样，我会还给他的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F50B332DE98E16F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"どうするかは彼が決めることだ。","source_cn":"他有权利决定如何处置自己的东西","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF6CF0DA42AFEAA60","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"どうするかは彼が決めることだ。","female":"どうするかは彼が決めることよ。","variant_male_record_index":"68930","variant_female_record_index":"68931","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1320326008:1":{"text":"グレイヴボーンにとって金銭の価値は無に等しい。","source_cn":"对于亡灵来说，钱财不值一提。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x359F31227D59C1AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:1:2":{"text":"売れば大金になるのに……","source_cn":"那可是一大笔钱……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEECC82E1C8BCB0F9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"売れば大金になるのに……","female":"売れば大金になるのに……","variant_male_record_index":"68932","variant_female_record_index":"68933","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1320326009:1":{"text":"ああ。僕は一刻も早く修復に取りかかりたい。","source_cn":"嗯。我只想尽快开始修复画作。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD39346C33E42BA52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:2:3":{"text":"かといって今からラピスラズリを探しに行くのもな……","source_cn":"总好过让我们去找青金石！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x190F3C111C49B8EA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"かといって今からラピスラズリを探しに行くのもな……","female":"かといって今からラピスラズリを探しに行くのもね……","variant_male_record_index":"68934","variant_female_record_index":"68935","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:柳博米尔":{"text":"リュボミル","source":"柳博米尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":17,"speaker_count":3}}